NOTE ON DUAL LICENSING
======================

This repository contains TWO kinds of work, licensed differently:

  1. The catalog content (data files, descriptions, prose in README and
     other docs) — released under CC0 1.0 (this file).

  2. The application source code (the React app under `src/`, build
     configs, scripts, GitHub Actions workflows) — released under MIT
     (see LICENSE-CODE).

If you are unsure which license applies, default to the more permissive
one for your use case. Contributions to either part are welcome.

